WEBVTT

1
00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:42.080
Well. of course you know
Justin Foley is a drug addict?

2
00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:45.708
<i>Well. you need to...</i>

3
00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:47.416
<i>for where we're going.</i>

4
00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:51.634
What?

5
00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:53.761
What's going on?

6
00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:55.388
Yeah.

7
00:00:55.806 --> 00:00:56.846
You tell me.

8
00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:03.110
- You went through my fucking shit?
- Let's skip the righteous anger

9
00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:05.828
and fast forward to you explaining
why you have an Oxy prescription

10
00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.899
- in the name of Bryce Walker.
- Fuck.

11
00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:09.775
Okay. Look. Clay.

12
00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:10.951
- Are you using again?
- No!

13
00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:13.199
- I don't believe you.
- I'm... I'm not!

14
00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:15.242
Jesus. Clay. I swear.

15
00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:18.086
You told me that the last time
you saw Bryce was at the end of summer.

16
00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.720
This prescription is from a month ago.
You guys stayed in contact.

17
00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:22.169
He sold these to you. didn't he?

18
00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:23.634
You've got it all wrong.

19
00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:26.089
Then explain it to me.
Where did you find the pills?

20
00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:27.630
At the Chatham house.

21
00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:29.879
Bryce's funeral.

22
00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:33.836
- Don't lie to me.
- I'm not! Dude. you...

23
00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:35.891
You saw me.

24
00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:38.465
Upstairs. in the hallway. Remember?

25
00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:41.851
I told you I was looking for the bathroom.

26
00:01:43.312 --> 00:01:46.772
I had just taken the Oxy
from Bryce's bathroom. that's...

27
00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:48.969
That's why I was acting so weird.

28
00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:51.236
but I'm telling you.
it was just that once.

29
00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.083
It was just that day.

30
00:01:59.077 --> 00:02:01.787
Bryce was dead.
and I was all fucked up.

31
00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:04.082
And I just went to look
for a place to chill.

32
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:06.496
and suddenly. I was in Bryce's room and...

33
00:02:07.252 --> 00:02:08.672
it was fucking with my head.

34
00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:13.296
I just felt empty and messed up and...

35
00:02:14.885 --> 00:02:15.885
just alone.

36
00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.730
- So. it was just one time?
- Yeah.

37
00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:25.227
I fucked up.

38
00:02:27.731 --> 00:02:29.231
I'm sorry. I'm really...

39
00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.444
I'm really sorry.

40
00:02:33.362 --> 00:02:34.362
Just please...

41
00:02:36.448 --> 00:02:37.568
don't tell your folks.

42
00:02:39.618 --> 00:02:40.988
<i>Because life with an addict</i>

43
00:02:43.705 --> 00:02:45.575
<i>means you never know what to believe.</i>

44
00:02:50.045 --> 00:02:52.335
<i>You're always waiting
for the next bad news.</i>

45
00:02:56.468 --> 00:02:57.548
What happened?

46
00:02:57.761 --> 00:02:58.931
Clay. honey. sit down.

47
00:02:59.596 --> 00:03:00.886
I don't want to sit down.

48
00:03:03.684 --> 00:03:05.814
You've officially been named
a person of interest

49
00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:06.904
