of that. right?

71
00:04:08.623 --> 00:04:09.623
No school today?

72
00:04:12.669 --> 00:04:13.999
It starts in half an hour.

73
00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.590
Yeah. I'm surprised you're going.

74
00:04:20.302 --> 00:04:21.302
I'm sorry?

75
00:04:24.806 --> 00:04:26.846
After the police named you
a person of interest

76
00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:29.483
