How does that feel?

77
00:04:29.561 --> 00:04:30.561
What the...

78
00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:32.727
- Who are you?
- Austin James.

79
00:04:33.023 --> 00:04:36.193
I write for <i>The Evergreen County Register.</i>
Just want to chat about the case.

80
00:04:36.276 --> 00:04:37.396
Hey. get the fuck out.

81
00:04:38.987 --> 00:04:40.197
Just enjoying a cup of coffee.

82
00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.990
All right. then we'll get the fuck out.

83
00:04:42.073 --> 00:04:44.953
If you come in here again. I'll see to it
that your coffee is pissed in.

84
00:04:50.373 --> 00:04:52.423
- Thanks for the save.
- Yeah. What a dick.

85
00:04:53.043 --> 00:04:54.293
<i>And here's the thing.</i>

86
00:04:55.629 --> 00:04:57.759
<i>When they made Clay a person of interest</i>

87
00:04:58.381 --> 00:05:00.551
<i>the searchlight shone on Justin. as well.</i>

88
00:05:01.301 --> 00:05:03.301
<i>So. it was only a matter of time...</i>

89
00:05:04.012 --> 00:05:05.012
You need a spot?

90
00:05:06.848 --> 00:05:08.388
