91
00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:11.143
Yeah. not from you.

92
00:05:11.853 --> 00:05:13.443
Man. your boy Clay is in some shit.

93
00:05:13.522 --> 00:05:17.442
Hey. Clay in shit.
He should change his name to shit.

94
00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:21.568
- Dude. you are so fucking stupid.
- You feeling all right?

95
00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:23.372
You look kinda sick.

96
00:05:27.786 --> 00:05:29.786
Did your boy find your stash?

97
00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.960
What the fuck do you know about it?

98
00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:34.039
