You know. Clay thinks you did it.

103
00:05:46.221 --> 00:05:48.971
He's just desperate.
It's not like he's got anything.

104
00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:51.386
I think he's got something.

105
00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:54.102
I think he knows exactly...

106
00:05:54.646 --> 00:05:55.646
