111
00:06:14.916 --> 00:06:17.246
<i>Clay felt every set of eyes on him.</i>

112
00:06:18.295 --> 00:06:20.165
<i>desperately searching for a way out.</i>

113
00:06:21.339 --> 00:06:23.879
