He said that shit was too addictive.

142
00:07:53.765 --> 00:07:55.345
That's oddly considerate.

143
00:07:55.809 --> 00:07:57.229
Yeah. I thought so.

144
00:07:59.813 --> 00:08:02.153
So. why do you want to know
if Bryce dealt Oxy?

145
00:08:03.692 --> 00:08:05.442
Um. you know. um...

146
00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.780
