- I don't blame you.

154
00:08:40.061 --> 00:08:44.111
Alex really fucked shit up for you.
Using me.

155
00:08:45.108 --> 00:08:47.898
So. transitively.
I fucked shit up for you.

156
00:08:48.528 --> 00:08:49.528
Math.

157
