232
00:13:16.754 --> 00:13:17.844
Okay. I'll go.

233
00:13:18.339 --> 00:13:20.059
Yeah. go back
to what you were doing before.

234
00:13:20.091 --> 00:13:21.801
Go do some drugs. Like white trash do.

235
00:13:21.884 --> 00:13:23.594
Hey. what the fuck did you just say to me?

236
00:13:23.678 --> 00:13:26.348
Hey. back off
and watch that language. That's a mile.

237
00:13:26.431 --> 00:13:28.891
