246
00:13:52.623 --> 00:13:53.623
You want three?

247
00:13:54.751 --> 00:13:55.751
Go.

248
00:13:57.295 --> 00:13:58.295
Go!

249
00:14:00.089 --> 00:14:02.839
<i>The way back isn't ever easy.</i>

250
00:14:04.302 --> 00:14:07.062
You can't eliminate student council
funding for the football team.

251
00:14:07.138 --> 00:14:09.218
You have plenty of funding
from the district.

252
00:14:09.349 --> 00:14:12.349
You have more funding than the drama
and music programs put together.

253
00:14:12.435 --> 00:14:14.935
We have more guys involved
than music and drama put together.

254
00:14:15.021 --> 00:14:16.021
We have four teams.

255
00:14:16.064 --> 00:14:18.904
I promised I would do everything I could
to eradicate jock culture.

256
00:14:18.983 --> 00:14:21.193
But you can't say
that jock culture is this or that.

257
00:14:21.277 --> 00:14:22.857
there isn't just one culture.

258
00:14:23.363 --> 00:14:24.363
And...

259
00:14:24.822 --> 00:14:26.502
I mean. we're changing things around here.

260
00:14:26.532 --> 00:14:30.332
Male athletic programs
not only protect athletes

261
00:14:30.411 --> 00:14:31.871
who commit sexual assault.

262
00:14:31.954 --> 00:14:34.834
they foster a culture
of violence and aggression

263
00:14:34.916 --> 00:14:36.626
that creates rapists every day.

264
00:14:37.001 --> 00:14:38.001
Jess...

265
00:14:40.213 --> 00:14:41.263
some guys do shit.

266
00:14:43.257 --> 00:14:44.717
Athletes and non-athletes.

267
00:14:45.051 --> 00:14:46.301
But for lots of guys.

268
00:14:46.386 --> 00:14:48.846
football's their only shot
at a college scholarship.

269
00:14:49.305 --> 00:14:52.265
Football. athletics.
for some people they're a lifeline.

270
00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:53.350
Like who?

271
