Like me.

272
00:14:56.354 --> 00:14:59.114
Look. I didn't want
to come back to football. but...

273
00:15:00.441 --> 00:15:01.481
once I did. it...

274
00:15:03.444 --> 00:15:05.704
it got me out of bed in the morning
and it...

275
00:15:06.823 --> 00:15:09.533
got me back in myself and shit that...

276
00:15:13.371 --> 00:15:15.461
I feel like myself for the first time...

277
00:15:16.749 --> 00:15:17.919
in a really long time.

278
00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.460
Look.

279
00:15:20.837 --> 00:15:22.047
