280
00:15:23.089 --> 00:15:24.759
In the end. you're not gonna win.

281
00:15:25.675 --> 00:15:27.135
Because we're not gonna give up.

282
00:15:32.598 --> 00:15:34.018
He's passed every drug test.

283
00:15:34.976 --> 00:15:36.136
hasn't missed a practice.

284
00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:37.769
