314
00:17:10.988 --> 00:17:13.368
Yeah. I kinda think everyone did.

315
00:17:16.077 --> 00:17:18.907
For what it's worth.
you've always been interesting to me.

316
00:17:19.372 --> 00:17:20.712
As a person.

317
00:17:23.834 --> 00:17:25.754
That was supposed to be a joke.

318
00:17:26.837 --> 00:17:28.547
Maybe it's not a time for jokes.

319
00:17:29.465 --> 00:17:31.175
Maybe I'm not good at jokes. Um...

320
00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:35.430
Little bit of both. but thanks for trying.

321
00:17:38.015 --> 00:17:39.845
Hey. would it be stupid if I...

322
00:17:40.977 --> 00:17:42.057
gave you some advice?

323
00:17:43.396 --> 00:17:44.936
About something I know about?

324
00:17:45.481 --> 00:17:46.481
Um...

325
00:17:47.233 --> 00:17:48.283
No. not...

326
00:17:49.068 --> 00:17:50.358
Not stupid. What's up?

327
00:17:53.781 --> 00:17:56.661
When people stare at you and talk...

328
00:17:58.077 --> 00:18:01.457
or they don't stare but you can tell
that they want to. just...

329
00:18:02.999 --> 00:18:04.999
just remember that you know who you are.

330
00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:06.960
and they don't.

331
00:18:10.715 --> 00:18:11.715
Right.

332
00:18:14.927 --> 00:18:15.927
Thanks. Ty.

333
00:18:21.809 --> 00:18:23.479
<i>Clay knew who he was...</i>

334
00:18:27.565 --> 00:18:30.225
