400
00:22:38.315 --> 00:22:39.315
Why do you say that?

401
00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:42.860
He's told you he stole a bottle
after the funeral? Just a one-off?

402
00:22:44.113 --> 00:22:45.493
Yeah. a one-time relapse.

403
00:22:45.573 --> 00:22:48.083
He says he found the pills
in Bryce's bedroom during the wake.

404
00:22:48.158 --> 00:22:49.158
