405
00:22:49.618 --> 00:22:52.708
After the police found Bryce's
steroid stash at the crime scene.

406
00:22:52.788 --> 00:22:54.118
they swept his room clean.

407
00:22:56.292 --> 00:22:57.292
Wait. what?

408
00:23:01.714 --> 00:23:02.714
Shit!

409
00:23:09.388 --> 00:23:10.388
Hey. there.

410
00:23:10.556 --> 00:23:11.806
Jess. not now.

411
00:23:12.057 --> 00:23:13.267
What? We're public.

412
00:23:13.350 --> 00:23:15.770
Yeah. and it feels like
you're making a big show out of it.

