00:23:15.853 --> 00:23:17.693
What the hell does that mean?

414
00:23:18.147 --> 00:23:20.067
It means that it doesn't feel like
it's about us.

415
00:23:20.149 --> 00:23:21.479
it feels like it's about you.

416
00:23:21.692 --> 00:23:24.362
It's not! What's going on with you?

417
00:23:24.445 --> 00:23:26.445
Just stop using me
to make a fucking point!

418
00:23:26.614 --> 00:23:27.614
I'm not!

419
00:23:27.823 --> 00:23:32.453
The only point I'm making is that
I love you and that's all that matters.

420
00:23:32.536 --> 00:23:33.656
Okay. well. you...

421
00:23:34.246 --> 00:23:36.246
you shouldn't love me. You shouldn't.

422
00:23:36.707 --> 00:23:37.787
What? Why not?

423
00:23:39.877 --> 00:23:41.497
Because I'm fucking bad for you!

424
00:23:42.212 --> 00:23:44.512
Hey. what are you saying right now?

425
00:23:45.424 --> 00:23:47.134
Talk to me. What's going on?

426
00:23:54.725 --> 00:23:55.725
