427
00:23:57.019 --> 00:23:59.229
- What?
- I said I cheated on you!

428
00:24:00.689 --> 00:24:01.689
I don't believe you.

429
00:24:02.274 --> 00:24:03.944
Okay. well. it's true. You should.

430
00:24:05.402 --> 00:24:06.402
When?

431
00:24:06.820 --> 00:24:09.570
- When did this happen?
- Homecoming night.

432
00:24:11.283 --> 00:24:14.583
You tried to call me. That's where I was.
I was with some other girl.

433
00:24:16.288 --> 00:24:17.288
Who?

434
00:24:19.083 --> 00:24:20.333
Jess. it doesn't matter.

435
00:24:22.336 --> 00:24:24.586
You just shouldn't be with me. okay?

436
00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:29.300
It's fucking over.

437
00:24:34.932 --> 00:24:37.522
<i>The Oxy that you stole
from Bryce's room.</i>

438
00:24:39.937 --> 00:24:41.437
where exactly did you find it?

439
00:24:44.525 --> 00:24:45.525
It was. um...

440
00:24:47.194 --> 00:24:49.664
It was in his medicine cabinet.
In the bathroom.

441
