Lies are harder to remember
than the truth. aren't they?

442
00:24:53.492 --> 00:24:55.242
I cleaned that bathroom out myself.

443
00:24:56.328 --> 00:24:57.618
You didn't find anything.

444
00:24:59.707 --> 00:25:00.787
Was he selling?

445
00:25:01.291 --> 00:25:02.631
And did you owe him money?

446
00:25:03.502 --> 00:25:06.172
Why would I kill Bryce
after he saved my fucking life?

447
00:25:13.387 --> 00:25:14.387
There you go.

448
00:25:18.350 --> 00:25:20.100
- Extra hot. please.
- Yeah.

449
00:25:22.438 --> 00:25:23.898
I like it when it burns.

450
00:25:24.857 --> 00:25:26.277
