455
00:25:46.295 --> 00:25:47.495
No. I'm not doing that.

456
00:25:48.630 --> 00:25:49.630
Then pay me.

457
00:25:55.721 --> 00:25:56.891
Can we not do this here?

458
00:25:58.432 --> 00:25:59.892
