465
00:27:31.150 --> 00:27:33.360
Now I just want my fucking money.

466
00:27:33.610 --> 00:27:35.490
- All right.
- I want 2.000.

467
00:27:35.988 --> 00:27:39.528
For what you owe and what you stole.
And I want it tomorrow.

468
00:27:40.701 --> 00:27:43.831
- I can't get it to you that fast. man.
