472
00:28:02.514 --> 00:28:03.514
Fuck...

473
00:28:34.713 --> 00:28:35.713
Thank you.

474
00:28:36.632 --> 00:28:37.632
Yeah.

475
00:28:38.342 --> 00:28:39.342
You okay?

476
00:28:41.011 --> 00:28:42.011
Yeah.

477
00:28:45.933 --> 00:28:46.933
My lawyer...

478
00:28:47.935 --> 00:28:49.935
