or a rehab. or some bullshit like that.
Maybe it works. maybe it doesn't.

767
00:49:40.269 --> 00:49:41.269
Maybe I just...

768
00:49:42.771 --> 00:49:45.521
get the hell out of here
and spare everyone the trouble.

769
00:49:47.443 --> 00:49:50.283
You... you don't want to do that.
though. right?

770
00:49:54.074 --> 00:49:55.074
I really...

771
00:49:56.660 --> 00:49:57.660
really don't.

772
00:50:16.680 --> 00:50:19.230
<i>You all made Clay
a person of interest.</i>

773
00:50:20.184 --> 00:50:22.984
<i>Isolated. Alone in the world.</i>

774
00:50:33.030 --> 00:50:34.320
<i>Except for Justin.</i>

775
00:50:38.577 --> 00:50:39.577
Just so you know...

776
00:50:42.164 --> 00:50:43.374
I'd do anything for you.

777
00:50:47.044 --> 00:50:48.044
Anything.

778
00:50:51.298 --> 00:50:52.298
Same.

779
00:50:53.842 --> 00:50:54.842
Anything.

780
00:50:59.682 --> 00:51:01.562
<i>They had a bond stronger than blood.</i>

781
00:51:02.893 --> 00:51:04.903
<i>Even if the blood was Bryce Walker's.</i>

782
00:51:24.290 --> 00:51:25.330
Hi. Mrs. Baker.

783
00:51:28.752 --> 00:51:32.012
Yeah. I'm sorry I didn't call you back.
I just...

784
00:51:33.340 --> 00:51:36.760
<i>Justin said
he'd do anything for Clay.</i>

785
00:51:38.804 --> 00:51:39.804
Yes.

786
00:51:40.639 --> 00:51:41.679
We should talk.

787
00:51:46.687 --> 00:51:48.517
All right. Yeah. I'll see you then.

788
00:51:50.065 --> 00:51:52.025
<i>And that was
about to get complicated.</i>

789
00:51:58.991 --> 00:51:59.991
Shit!

790
00:52:12.546 --> 00:52:14.586
<i>For help finding crisis resources.</i>

791
00:52:14.673 --> 00:52:17.343
<i>visit 13reasonswhy.info.</i>

792
00:54:09.079 --> 00:54:10.909
<i>Well done. Ed. well done.</i>
